WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:05.740
The right loves to say that the left is waging
a culture war rather than an issues based

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:06.740
war.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:10.170
But I am going to make the case today that
it is effectively the Donald Trump administration

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.560
that is actually doing that.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:15.530
The last 12 hours on Twitter for Donald Trump
have been very, very wacky.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.970
He will not or cannot stop lying.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.400
He seemed to defend the Confederate flag.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:25.800
He tweeted more racism, including referring
to Indian Elizabeth Warren.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.400
And the context of all of this is Trump's
approval is down to 38 percent.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.239
Trump is losing by an average of seven in
Michigan, losing by six in Wisconsin and Pennsylvania

00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:40.379
losing by five, and Florida losing by three
in Arizona.

00:00:40.379 --> 00:00:44.690
And he's just falling apart visibly, publicly
and embarrassingly.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:47.839
And we're going to go through just a couple
of these elements and then circle back to

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:49.959
the culture war component.

00:00:49.959 --> 00:00:55.159
Trump continued his empirically demonstrable
lies related to Corona virus, which is, of

00:00:55.159 --> 00:00:56.679
course, spreading.

00:00:56.679 --> 00:01:02.260
As I told you yesterday, we are seeing pretty
dramatic approval cratering for Trump in the

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:05.530
most affected counties by Corona virus.

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:12.810
Trump tweeting, quote, Why does the lame stream
fake news media refuse to say that China virus

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:18.969
deaths are down thirty nine percent and that
we now have the lowest fatality mortality

00:01:18.969 --> 00:01:20.470
rate in the world?

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.330
They just can't stand that.

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:26.329
We are doing so well for our capital C country.

00:01:26.329 --> 00:01:29.679
Now, this is just not true about the mortality
rate.

00:01:29.679 --> 00:01:34.439
We have the ninth highest per capita death
rate in the world.

00:01:34.439 --> 00:01:38.350
Out of more than 200 countries and territories,
ninth highest.

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:44.340
If you don't include tiny countries like San
Marino and Andorra, the U.S. has the seventh

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:47.100
highest per capita death rate in the world.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.409
So Trump is lying.

00:01:48.409 --> 00:01:53.960
Now, in terms of the decrease in deaths, I'm
glad we've seen a trending down in deaths.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:56.780
There's a bunch of possibilities still on
the table.

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:59.179
The deaths haven't happened because of a lag
time.

00:01:59.179 --> 00:02:01.450
They would start this week, presumably.

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:06.780
We already saw yesterday Texas tie their record
high for single day deaths.

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:08.289
Could be a less deadly strain.

00:02:08.289 --> 00:02:12.230
That's a possibility, although we don't actually
have evidence for that yet.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.220
There could be states that are lying about
the death toll.

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:17.330
Could be younger folks lately.

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:22.040
Getting the virus who are less likely to die
could mean that more testing is leading to

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:27.340
more tests for people who are less sick, which
is going to reduce that comparative death

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:28.340
rate.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:29.340
We just don't know yet.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:34.610
But what we are seeing, at least in Texas,
is that those death numbers are starting to

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:36.050
go up.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.580
Then Trump moved on to talking about Elizabeth
Warren.

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:45.750
Donald Trump, of course, focusing lately on
statues and sports team names, tweeting, quote,

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:48.870
They name teams out of strength, not weakness.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:55.930
But now the Washington Redskins and Cleveland
Indians, two fabled sports franchises look

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:59.830
like they are going to be changing their names
in order to be politically correct.

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:05.549
Indians like Elizabeth Warren must be very
angry right now.

00:03:05.549 --> 00:03:10.110
I'm not even going to insult your intelligence
by doing an analysis of that one.

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:12.920
I think you all get the wackiness of that
one.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:17.510
And then on to the Confederate flag, tweeting,
quote, Has Bubba Wallace apologize to all

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:22.560
of those great NASCAR drivers and officials
who came to his aid, stood by his side and

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:28.060
were willing to sacrifice everything for him,
only to find out that the whole thing was

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.110
just another hoax.

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:34.760
That and flag decision has cost lowest ratings
ever.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:39.050
So what Trump is referring to there is that
NASCAR made a decision that the Confederate

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:41.290
flag would not be allowed at their events.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:42.970
It won't be allowed in the crowd.

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:48.010
It won't be allowed on cars or in team areas
or whatever Trump says.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:51.270
That is why ratings are down for NASCAR.

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:56.019
So question one is where people really tuning
into NASCAR for the Confederate flag, because

00:03:56.019 --> 00:03:58.200
if so, that would be really weird.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:03.629
But next, what I want to get to is that when
this came up during Kaley McKenzies press

00:04:03.629 --> 00:04:08.989
briefing yesterday, again, a really bad day
for Trump once again.

00:04:08.989 --> 00:04:13.469
Reportedly, Trump is watching more TV than
ever and is in his own world.

00:04:13.469 --> 00:04:19.660
Kaili McEnany refused to even say whether
Trump is indeed saying he supports the Confederate

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.700
flag here or not.

00:04:21.700 --> 00:05:24.080
And that's what I want to talk about next.

